  "description": "Yoo Hae-Young was a child star with a bright future, but now, at 29, he just drifts through life. However, everything changes when the famous actor Jung Yeo-Woon asks Hae-Young to be his manager and even suggests that they live together! Though Hae-Young has spent his life avoiding the spotlight due to his past successes, he accepts the job and things seem to go well until he catches Yeo-Woon touching himself. Now, Hae-Young can't get Yeo-Woon off his mind, and it doesn't help that they're together all day and night long. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
